{"id":"wb-3-4","name":"大沽口炮台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大沽口炮台","text":"大沽口炮台是近代中国主要军事防御设施之一，也是三次大沽口战役主战场。该遗址目前位于中国天津市滨海新区东炮台路。目前，大沽口炮台被中华人民共和国国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位，天津市文物保护单位和中华人民共和国全国爱国主义教育示范基地，目前为大沽口炮台博物馆和大沽口炮台遗址公园，为“津门十景”之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B2%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":95386415,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95386415","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bb07d3dcdd0fed7d117c52e4.jpg","title":"天津大沽口炮台1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%A4%A7%E6%B2%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%A4%A7%E6%B2%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"KangTyngrwey","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​天津滨海大沽口炮台与远方的于家堡商务区","width":320,"height":261}}